  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Alcohol Drugs and Development -  Prevention and reduction of alcohol use</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will work for implementation of alcohol policies and legislation in communities in 4 districts. Through CBOs and local government, activities will create resilience against initiation to alcohol and integrate alcohol prevention in plans of local government and CSOs. The project will advocate for district monitoring and regulatory mechanisms. The work will coordinate with national level authorities and SLAPA for effectiveness and facilitation of applicable experience and advocacy.</narrative>
  </description>
